        "value": 2
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1",
            "duration": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 2
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pallas",
        "text": "This is the first time you've shown, since that young acolyte of yours glared at me last week."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra",
        "text": "It's not easy, managing Endymion Temple and the rebuilding of the First Temple at the same time."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra",
        "text": "Folia is just worried that I'm overworked. She knows we've been friends since our priest school days."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#20$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pallas",
        "text": "Which made it all the harder to accept that I brought you trouble as soon as I got back, I guess."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#4$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra",
        "text": "Pallas..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra",
        "text": "I knew we were both in trouble when you showed up at Endymion Temple to have your dream interpreted as an ordinary Minoan instead of using the priests' passage, six months ago."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra",
        "text": "In most cases, divine revelation can be classified into certain common categories, whether it came in the form of a dream or a sudden vision."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pallas",
        "text": "I know. We learned them by heart at school, so ordinary priests without special talents could guide those who received revelations."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#6$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra",
        "text": "But the vision that you brought was not found in any classic tale... I had no doubt that it was a powerful revelation, which made me very uneasy."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pallas",
        "text": "Don't worry. We'll find a way."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#4$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra",
        "text": "You shouldn't have quit the priesthood. You might have been able to find help..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pallas",
        "text": "And hide my condition, continuing to be the legendary 'Goddess of Victory' on the border?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pallas",
        "text": "I didn't want to complicate things, even if another has taken up the title. Besides, the heroes came a long way to call me back. I had to be honest with myself."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra",
        "text": "...Looks like Rhodes Island has treated you well."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#16$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pallas",
        "text": "Of course. Did I ever tell you that I founded a 'Minoan League' on Rhodes Island?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#6$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra",
        "text": "Are there so many Minoans who left home to seek treatment?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pallas",
        "text": "There are plenty, although Erato and Vulcan are the only true Minoans in the league. The others are in it because they have a spiritual fascination with our country."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pallas",
        "text": "I'll introduce them, when we have a chance. They're all full of heroic spirit, with great passion for poetry, art, and brewing."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra",
        "text": "So you founded a drinking league."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#11$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pallas",
        "text": "That's one way to put it. It's not quite the same as having you around, though. You may not hold your drink particularly well, but no one in our year brewed better than you."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pallas",
        "text": "I remember how you tied up your sleeves and pounded the grapes like a seasoned winemaker at the intercollegiate conference. You looked amazing."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra",
        "text": "..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra",
        "text": "I see you have a craving. What happened to the formula I gave you?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pallas",
        "text": "I lost it when I went to Akroti. I finally escaped my torment when my Sarkaz bodyguard gave me the recipe for the secret brew of Kazdel."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#3$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra",
        "text": "I never worried you would have trouble making friends. First the Sarkaz bodyguard, now the Sargonian ambassador."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pallas",
        "text": "..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pallas",
        "text": "You heard about the fruit farmers and the craftsmen. Titi can be trusted."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#6$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra",
        "text": "I don't doubt Kyr\u00eda Mashayer's cleverness, or her friendly outlook towards our country, but her position remains sensitive."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra",
        "text": "If I didn't stop you, would you have put her in charge of the play that we already discussed, in addition to the venue of the exchange ceremony?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra",
        "text": "Is it that you trust her too much, or...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#4$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pallas",
        "text": "You're frowning again, Kassandra. I just let myself get a little lazy, having been away from the priesthood for so long."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#4$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra",
        "text": "You would never have become a legend in the borderlands, if you were the type to shirk responsibility."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra",
        "text": "I don't mind taking charge of the rebuilding project on your behalf. I just think it's a shame. You're better at dealing with people, and the craftsmen trust you."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra",
        "text": "I thought you made the proposal to the people so they would return to heroic tradition and remember the heroic spirit."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#11$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pallas",
        "text": "I did."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pallas",
        "text": "And that's exactly why it doesn't matter who's in charge."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#7$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pallas",
        "text": "Our people venerate the heroes, but they've gradually forgotten that Minoan prosperity was not only built by a few heroes."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#4$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra",
        "text": "'The heroes came from the people, from all walks of life.'"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pallas",
        "text": "You could always read my mind."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#4$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra",
        "text": "I know what you're trying to say... but with the rebuilding of the temple entering its final stage, it's even more important than ever to have a supervisor."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pallas",
        "text": "I think we'll have one soon."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_2068_1#5$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kassandra",
        "text": "What is it?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#16$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pallas",
        "text": "I saw Lydia headed to the temple square."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#1$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Pallas",
        "text": "What do you think this Astynomos, who has quietly been at odds with us from the beginning and is trying to take the play out of the priests' hands, is going there for?"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "stopmusic",
        "params": {
            "fadetime": 2
        }
    },
    {
