        }
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 2
    },
    {
        "command": "playmusic",
        "params": {
            "key": "$normal_loop",
            "volume": 0.6
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 0,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
            "b": 0,
            "fadetime": 2,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
            "volume": 0.6
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1",
            "posfrom": "200,0",
            "posto": "0,0",
            "afrom": 0,
            "ato": 1,
            "duration": 1.5
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 2.5
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lydia",
        "text": "We meet at last, Your Excellency Ambassador Mashayer."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Titi",
        "text": "And who might you be?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lydia",
        "text": "I'm the Astynomos of Athenius, called Lydia. I am overseeing this relic exchange between our two nations."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#11$2",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Titi",
        "text": "Oh! I'm so sorry, Astynomos. I should have visited you first thing when I got to Athenius. I didn't think..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#3$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lydia",
        "text": "You came into Athenius by the ancient route to follow in Kereseira's footsteps, didn't you?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lydia",
        "text": "There is no need to apologize to a Minoan for your love of our epics, our culture."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lydia",
        "text": "If anything, I should be thanking you for resolving the dispute between the fruit farmers and craftsmen. The rebuilding of the First Temple could not have proceeded so smoothly without you."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Titi",
        "text": "I simply did my part."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Titi",
        "text": "I believe you've already met Behnui? I take it the venue and details of the exchange ceremony have not been confirmed."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lydia",
        "text": "Correct."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Titi",
        "text": "Rather than do it behind closed doors in a private room, what do you think of holding the ceremony beneath the statue of Kereseira, to be witnessed by her and all of Athenius?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lydia",
        "text": "You want to hold the exchange ceremony at the First Temple square?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$2",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Titi",
        "text": "Yes. You are aware that I brought the most precious treasure of the Varjavandabad Museum, to be exchanged for the technical data that the Sargonians left behind during the construction of the Three Poleis."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Titi",
        "text": "It's a part of many heroic Minoan stories, and closely linked to Kereseira herself."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Titi",
        "text": "Seeing the completed statue on the square was an awe-inspiring experience. Her brave visage and the relic that I carry complement each other."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Titi",
        "text": "I understand that the exchange ceremony is supposed to begin with a classical play, in accordance with Minoan tradition. What better place to do it than the First Temple's new amphitheater?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#9$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lydia",
        "text": "..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Titi",
        "text": "Would that be a problem?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Titi",
        "text": "Oh, Kassandra from Endymion Temple reminded me that any use of the First Temple should be discussed with her..."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lydia",
        "text": "Kassandra..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lydia",
        "text": "It's the Astynomos' Office's responsibility to lighten the burden on the busy priests by handling trivial matters. I'll communicate with her."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lydia",
        "text": "I was concerned about the lack of proper supervision in the rebuilding process because of the emulation of ancient methods, which has resulted in significant delays. I thought it might not be the most dignified of venues."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Titi",
        "text": "I don't mind\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lydia",
        "text": "However, all our problems could be solved if you are officially made the supervisor of the rebuilding project."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#3$2",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Titi",
        "text": "Say what now?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#7$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lydia",
        "text": "The rebuilding of the temple is entering its final stages. We've reached the point where decisiveness and efficiency are more important than careful planning."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lydia",
        "text": "I'm sure you already have a fair idea of what is going on, having befriended the craftsmen and solved their issues."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#3$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lydia",
        "text": "Besides, I understand that you received an advanced education in museology in Columbia, including studies in architecture."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lydia",
        "text": "Putting the finishing touches on the temple and readying it for opening shouldn't present too much difficulty, should it?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$2",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Titi",
        "text": "I mean, it's true that I designed and supervised the expansion of my museum, but it's not nearly as big as this temple..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Titi",
        "text": "Besides, is it really appropriate for a Sargonian ambassador to supervise the rebuilding of the First Temple?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#3$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lydia",
        "text": "Your request that the exchange ceremony take place at the First Temple is ample proof of your understanding of the relic and Minoan culture."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lydia",
        "text": "I am in full support of your proposal, and I'm sure the ever-considerate Kassandra won't object."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$2",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Titi",
        "text": "But..."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "I didn't expect the ambassador to be such a polite and humble young lady."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$2",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lydia",
        "text": "Per\u00edandros?"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
            "volume": 0.6
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_2078_1#1$1",
            "duration": 1.5
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 2.5
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_2078_1#10$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Per\u00edandros",
        "text": "Greetings from Corinia, land of trade and merchants, Your Excellency Ambassador Mashayer of Sargon."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Per\u00edandros",
        "text": "I am here as Corinia's representative to the exchange ceremony, at the Astynomos' request. I happened to overhear your conversation and couldn't help but stop to listen."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Per\u00edandros",
        "text": "May I ask you a question\u2014would you participate in the rebuilding of the First Temple, if your status were not a concern?"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Titi",
        "text": "Of course!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Titi",
        "text": "It would be a great honor to participate in the restoration of such a wonderful example of Minoan architecture, not to mention the knowledge that could be gained! I would be delighted just to hew one piece of marble for it!"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_2078_1#10$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Per\u00edandros",
        "text": "In that case, why trouble yourself unnecessarily?"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$2",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1",
            "focus": "l"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Titi",
        "text": "Trouble myself... what?"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_2078_1#10$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Per\u00edandros",
        "text": "I have a little suggestion that might solve our present problem. As I see it, the two of you are in full agreement, but for this little issue of Ambassador Mashayer's status."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_2078_1#11$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Per\u00edandros",
        "text": "It's a sensitive issue, and Ambassador Mashayer's concerns are certainly well-founded. On the other hand, the Astynomos here is seeking a capable supervisor who has the support of the people, in order to keep the temple project on track."
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_2078_1#10$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Per\u00edandros",
        "text": "What better way to resolve this than Minos's most ancient process?"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "l",
            "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$2",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "r",
            "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1",
            "focus": "r"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Lydia",
        "text": "You mean...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_npc_2078_1#10$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Per\u00edandros",
        "text": "A vote."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Per\u00edandros",
        "text": "A referendum held on the First Temple square. Let the citizens of Athenius participating in the rebuilding decide whether to accept Ambassador Mashayer's supervision or not."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
