    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#14$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Xanthos",
        "text": "...She's really the Sargonian ambassador."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Xanthos",
        "text": "Travesty! The theater of Kereseira's First Temple was not built to host a diplomatic farce!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Xanthos",
        "text": "That Sargonian said she brought a relic in exchange for the technical data from the Three Poleis? I knew that cargo didn't feel like movie figurines."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Xanthos",
        "text": "The shape, the weight, and its relevance to Kereseira... could it be...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "charslot",
        "params": {
            "slot": "m",
            "name": "avg_4166_varkis_1#6$1",
            "focus": "m"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Xanthos",
        "text": "The gall! To use stolen Minoan treasure to buy Minoan trust!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Xanthos",
        "text": "Not if I have anything to say about it..."
    },
